{"seq":3,"slug":"carrier-portfolio-capacity-risk","title":"承运商组合与旺季产能风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/procurement-performance/carrier-portfolio-capacity-risk","wordCount":2044,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"承运商组合与旺季产能风险\">承运商组合与旺季产能风险</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把价格压到最低的采购结构，往往也是最脆弱的。单一承运商拿到全部货量时议价能力最强，但它一次运力故障就能让你的整条链路停摆；旺季时所有采购方都在抢舱位，此时决定成败的不是合同价，而是<strong>你有没有分散在多个承运商手里的舱位关系</strong>。组合管理的目标就是在价格与韧性之间找到一个可承受的平衡点，并把这个平衡点写成可监控的指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集中度-可以量化但不能只看一个数\">集中度：可以量化但不能只看一个数</h2><p>集中度有多种度量，各有盲区：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>盲区</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承运商数量</td>\n<td>池内承运商总数</td>\n<td>直观</td>\n<td>不反映份额分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CR-n</td>\n<td>前 n 家份额之和</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>忽略长尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HHI</td>\n<td>各份额平方和</td>\n<td>反映整体集中度</td>\n<td>对小幅调整不敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单点依赖度</td>\n<td>最大单家份额</td>\n<td>直接对应风险</td>\n<td>忽略第二梯队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>赫芬达尔—赫希曼指数（HHI）是最通用的一个：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HHI</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HHI} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} s_i^2, \\qquad s_i = \\frac{Q_i}{\\sum_j Q_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HHI</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4821em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>份额取 0–1 时，HHI 的范围是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（完全均分）到 1（独家垄断）。它的一个有用性质是：<strong>同样两家承运商 70/30 分配，HHI = 0.58；改成 50/50，HHI = 0.50</strong>——变化不大，但韧性差别显著。所以 HHI 不能单独用，必须配合<strong>单点依赖度</strong>（最大份额）一起看。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集中度要按维度算-不是按总量算\">集中度要按维度算，不是按总量算</h3><p>只看整体份额会漏掉结构性风险。真正决定风险的是<strong>分维度</strong>的集中度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按 lane</strong>：某条关键 lane 是否只有一家承运商可走。</li>\n<li><strong>按品类</strong>：海运整箱有多家，尾程是否只有一家。</li>\n<li><strong>按区域</strong>：某个目的国是否完全依赖一家本地派送商。</li>\n<li><strong>按设备</strong>：冷藏箱、开顶箱等特殊设备是否只有一家能供。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条实用的风险规则是：<strong>任何&quot;关键维度组合&quot;（关键 lane × 主要品类）上的单一承运商份额不应超过阈值</strong>（常见 60–70%）。这个阈值不是行业常数，应该由业务中断的容忍度反推——若这条 lane 停摆 7 天会直接影响销售，阈值就该更低。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分维度集中度：按 (lane, 品类) 计算单点依赖度&#10;WITH share AS (&#10;  SELECT lane_id, category_code, carrier_id,&#10;         SUM(billed_weight) AS vol,&#10;         SUM(SUM(billed_weight)) OVER (PARTITION BY lane_id, category_code) AS total_vol&#10;  FROM freight_volume_cube&#10;  WHERE week_start &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;52 weeks&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY lane_id, category_code, carrier_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT lane_id, category_code,&#10;       COUNT(*)                                        AS carrier_count,&#10;       SUM(POWER(vol / NULLIF(total_vol,0), 2))        AS hhi,&#10;       MAX(vol / NULLIF(total_vol,0))                  AS top_share,&#10;       (ARRAY_AGG(carrier_id ORDER BY vol DESC))[1]     AS top_carrier&#10;FROM share&#10;GROUP BY lane_id, category_code&#10;HAVING MAX(vol / NULLIF(total_vol,0)) &gt; 0.60&#10;ORDER BY top_share DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分维度集中度：按 (lane, 品类) 计算单点依赖度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, category_code, carrier_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vol,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(billed_weight)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, category_code) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_vol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight_volume_cube</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> week_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'52 weeks'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, category_code, carrier_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, category_code,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">POWER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_vol,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hhi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_vol,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top_share,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (ARRAY_AGG(carrier_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))[1]     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top_carrier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> share</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lane_id, category_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_vol,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> top_share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询直接输出<strong>需要关注的高依赖组合</strong>，按依赖度排序。它应该是一个定期跑动的看板，而不是年底盘点时才想起来的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"旺季产能风险-为什么合同价在旺季失效\">旺季产能风险：为什么合同价在旺季失效</h2><p>旺季（peak season）的问题不是价格，而是<strong>舱位可得性</strong>。当市场舱位供不应求时，承运商会优先服务两类货主：长期大客户，以及愿意付即期高价的货主。此时你手里的长约如果只约定了价格、没有约定舱位保障机制，就只是一张纸。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三类保障机制\">三类保障机制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最低货量承诺 (MQC)</td>\n<td>我承诺买多少</td>\n<td>弱（是义务不是权利）</td>\n<td>抵消价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>舱位保证 (MFO/space guarantee)</td>\n<td>你必须给我多少</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>抬高基价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自有运力/包舱</td>\n<td>我买下运力</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>资金占用大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意第一行的方向：<strong>MQC 单向约束采购方</strong>，它是采购方给承运商的承诺，不是承运商给采购方的保证。很多合同只写了 MQC 而没有对应的舱位保证，结果是旺季时采购方既要履行购货义务，又拿不到舱位——这是合同结构上的不对称，必须在谈判时补齐。MQC 与线运费率、履约赔偿、有效期同为海运服务合同的必备条款项（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-46/part-530\">46 CFR § 530.8</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"旺季的产能压力有公开信号\">旺季的产能压力有公开信号</h3><p>旺季风险的评估不该完全依赖内部数据。集装箱即期运价有公开的周度指数可作参照，例如 Drewry 的世界集装箱指数按主要东西向航线逐周发布运价（<a href=\"https://www.drewry.co.uk/supply-chain-advisors/world-container-index-assessed-by-drewry\">Drewry World Container Index</a>）。当指数快速上行时，说明市场舱位趋紧，此时应提前启动应急预案（提前锁舱、临时增加二线承运商、将部分货量前移）。<strong>用公开指数做领先指标，比等到自己订不到舱位时才发现要便宜得多。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"应急预案要有预置路径\">应急预案要有预置路径</h3><p>旺季应急不是临时找承运商，而是<strong>提前铺好路径</strong>：二线承运商的资质预审、价格框架协议、系统对接测试都要在淡季完成。没有预置路径的应急等于没有应急——旺季时所有人都在找运力，临时开始走资质流程会错过窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合结构与韧性\">组合结构与韧性</h2><p>承运商组合的经典结构是&quot;<strong>核心 + 备份 + 机会</strong>&quot;三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>份额</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>准入标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心 (core)</td>\n<td>60–75%</td>\n<td>主力承接，深度集成</td>\n<td>全维度达标 + 系统直连</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备份 (backup)</td>\n<td>20–30%</td>\n<td>随时可切换，保持活跃</td>\n<td>关键维度达标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机会 (opportunity)</td>\n<td>5–10%</td>\n<td>试验新承运商或新航线</td>\n<td>基本资质 + 小批量验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在<strong>备份层要保持&quot;热&quot;</strong>：如果备份承运商常年零货量，它的价格条款会失效、对接会退化、旺季时也不会有舱位给你。所以组合管理必须包含一个<strong>最小活跃度约束</strong>——每个备份承运商每期至少承接一定比例或一定数量的货量，即使它的价格略高于核心层。这是&quot;用一点溢价买可选性&quot;的典型决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[运量立方体&lt;br/&gt;按 lane/品类/承运商] --&gt; B[分维度集中度&lt;br/&gt;HHI + 单点依赖]&#10;  B --&gt; C{top_share &gt; 阈值?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[标记高依赖组合&lt;br/&gt;启动分散]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[组合健康]&#10;  F[公开运价指数&lt;br/&gt;周度] --&gt; G{快速上行?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[启动旺季预案&lt;br/&gt;提前锁舱/货量前移]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[常规监控]&#10;  D --&gt; J[调整三层结构&lt;br/&gt;核心/备份/机会]&#10;  H --&gt; K[启用预置二线路径]&#10;  J --&gt; L[组合看板]&#10;  K --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[运量立方体&lt;br/&gt;按 lane/品类/承运商] --&gt; B[分维度集中度&lt;br/&gt;HHI + 单点依赖]\n  B --&gt; C{top_share &gt; 阈值?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[标记高依赖组合&lt;br/&gt;启动分散]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[组合健康]\n  F[公开运价指数&lt;br/&gt;周度] --&gt; G{快速上行?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[启动旺季预案&lt;br/&gt;提前锁舱/货量前移]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[常规监控]\n  D --&gt; J[调整三层结构&lt;br/&gt;核心/备份/机会]\n  H --&gt; K[启用预置二线路径]\n  J --&gt; L[组合看板]\n  K --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"承运商退出-最容易被忽略的风险\">承运商退出：最容易被忽略的风险</h2><p>组合风险的极端形态是<strong>承运商突然退出某条航线或破产</strong>。这类事件前通常有可观测的预警信号：准班率持续下降、设备（空箱）可得性恶化、财务披露恶化、市场上出现关于其运力调整的公开消息。组合管理应该把这些信号纳入监控，并预先为每一个&quot;关键维度组合&quot;指定<strong>替代路径</strong>（哪家可以在多少天内补上多少产能）。</p>\n<p>替代路径的可行性必须被验证过，而不是写在文档里。验证方式就是前面说的最小活跃度约束——真正走过货的备份承运商，才是真的备份。承运商退出与履约恶化往往是同一组信号的先后阶段，因此这套预警应直接复用 <a href=\"carrier-contract-scorecard-link\">合同履约与 scorecard 联动</a> 里的履约指标作为触发源，而不是另建一套采集。</p>\n<p>值得警惕的是分散化本身的成本。把货量切给多家承运商，意味着单家议价能力下降、系统对接成本上升、以及跨承运商的对账复杂度增加——后者会直接抬高 <a href=\"../freight-bill-audit-payment/pre-post-freight-audit-rule\">运费账单审计</a> 的工作量，因为每个承运商的代码表与账单格式都不同。所以组合分散的度不是&quot;越多越好&quot;，而是在集中度阈值与运营成本之间取一个可承受的点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>集中度不能只看总量，必须按 lane、品类、区域、设备四个维度分别算。</li>\n<li>HHI 反映整体分布但变化不敏感，必须与单点依赖度（最大份额）配合使用；关键维度组合的单一承运商份额不应超过由中断容忍度反推的阈值。</li>\n<li>MQC 是采购方的单向义务，不是承运商的舱位保证；缺舱位保证的合同在旺季只是纸面价格。</li>\n<li>旺季产能风险有公开领先指标（如周度集装箱运价指数）；应急预案需要淡季预置的二线路径。</li>\n<li>组合用&quot;核心 / 备份 / 机会&quot;三层结构，备份层必须保持热（最小活跃度约束），这是用溢价买可选性。</li>\n<li>承运商退出的预警信号要纳入监控，且每个关键维度组合必须有经验证过的替代路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承运商组合与旺季产能风险","id":"承运商组合与旺季产能风险"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"集中度：可以量化但不能只看一个数","id":"集中度-可以量化但不能只看一个数"},{"level":3,"text":"集中度要按维度算，不是按总量算","id":"集中度要按维度算-不是按总量算"},{"level":2,"text":"旺季产能风险：为什么合同价在旺季失效","id":"旺季产能风险-为什么合同价在旺季失效"},{"level":3,"text":"三类保障机制","id":"三类保障机制"},{"level":3,"text":"旺季的产能压力有公开信号","id":"旺季的产能压力有公开信号"},{"level":3,"text":"应急预案要有预置路径","id":"应急预案要有预置路径"},{"level":2,"text":"组合结构与韧性","id":"组合结构与韧性"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商退出：最容易被忽略的风险","id":"承运商退出-最容易被忽略的风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"采购节省度量与 should-cost","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/freight-procurement-contract-audit/procurement-performance/saving-measurement-should-cost"},"next":null}